{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005500/extras/3232394301ffe2c423be2c26a0e05641.avif?t=1773674417\" width=1328 height=492 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005500/extras/f2da8e593d6f0ab5b819dcb69249093a.poster.avif?t=1773674417\" width=792 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005500/extras/f2da8e593d6f0ab5b819dcb69249093a.webm?t=1773674417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005500/extras/f2da8e593d6f0ab5b819dcb69249093a.mp4?t=1773674417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRU</strong> is a first-person shooter that draws inspiration from early 2000's FPS games, in a highly atmospheric setting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up with several different weapons you find along the way, fight a multitude of  hellish enemies, and attempt to restore order in a world teetering on the brink.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An atmospheric shooter experience, with emphasis on brutalism and megastructures; </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way across several handcrafted and highly detailed levels;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies using heavy-hitting weapons designed to make you feel powerful;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore around to find secret passages and hidden collectibles;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be immersed at all times with superb sound design and music;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The end is upon us. The veil between our world and theirs wears thin. We are in need of your assistance now more than ever, lest we lose everything. Tell me, ordinate... will you help your kind?\u00a0</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCLAIMER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>CRU</i></strong><i> contains flashing lights which may not be suitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005500/extras/9ea7dee4b20878a332026d9f350c1e44.poster.avif?t=1773674417\" width=792 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005500/extras/9ea7dee4b20878a332026d9f350c1e44.webm?t=1773674417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005500/extras/9ea7dee4b20878a332026d9f350c1e44.mp4?t=1773674417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4005500?t=1773674417","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4005500?t=1773674417","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005500/60c949217c101711c2f8b57ef0dcabc145598add/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773674417","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005500/60c949217c101711c2f8b57ef0dcabc145598add/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773674417","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Players can kill enemies and they can explode into bloody gibs. Players fight enemies that have disturbing characteristics. Players 